  "body": "Offered to the market for the first time in over 30 years, this is an exciting opportunity for renovators, builders and savvy buyers looking to unlock the potential of a property in a well-established and convenient location.\r\n\r\nWith a sunny conservatory, spacious kitchen and generous double garage, there is plenty to work with and scope to add value. A bonus is the well-established, private garden, providing a lovely green setting to enjoy. A rare offering, early offers are encouraged.\r\n\r\n*      No Body Corporate \r\n\r\n*      Two off-street parks\r\n\r\n*      Walking distance to Highland Park Shopping Centre\r\n\r\n*      A short drive to Bucklands Beach and Eastern Beach\r\n\r\n*      Close to Half Moon Bay Marina and ferry services\r\n\r\n*      Zoned for Macleans Primary School, Howick Intermediate and Pakuranga College\r\n\r\n*      Convenient access to local cafes, shops and amenities\r\n\r\nBring your vision, roll up your sleeves and explore the potential. \r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are increasingly hard to find - inspect without delay!",
